    "description": "Artist Unknown\nAgate and Geode Specimen Set\nPolished Agate and Natural Crystal Geode\nTotal Weight: 3.0 lbs\nUnsigned\nThis set of two geological specimens features a large, polished teal-blue agate slice and a natural crystal geode. The blue specimen is expertly cut with a flat base and polished faces, showcasing deep color saturation and a natural crystalline window. The companion piece is a classic geode with a detailed crystalline cavity surrounded by delicate grey and white agate banding, showing natural formation layers.\nLarge blue specimen functions well as a decorative bookend or shelf accent\nGeode features intricate internal crystal structures and smooth outer host rock\nTotal combined weight of 3.0 pounds as measured on digital scale\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition. The polished surfaces of the blue specimen are smooth with minor surface abrasions consistent with age. The natural geode remains intact with well-defined crystal formations and stable banding. No major chips or cracks beyond natural geological inclusions.\nMerchandise is sold As Is. Returns will only be accepted with prior authorization and under the terms stated in this Return Policy. If you have questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item please contact Goodwill of Silicon Valley at 408-869-9262 prior to placing your bid. Items may be returned within seven (7) days of receipt if the merchandise was damaged during shipping or if there was a major distortion in the description. Returns will not be accepted without prior authorization. PLEASE NOTE THAT WE DO NOT REFUND SHIPPING AND HANDLING\nCHARGES. Items selected for pick up from the seller, must be picked up within thirty (30) days from close of auction. Items not picked up from seller within thirty (30) days from close of auction will be resold with no further\nnotice.\nLocal Pickup Policy\nAll items must be picked up within 30 days of purchase.\nAny item not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be resold without any prior notification.\nAll items picked up must be picked up by the individual named in the profile.\nNo 3rd party pickups without prior approval.\nIdentification is required to be shown when picking up all orders\nPayment for items not picked up within 30 days of purchase will be refunded automatically.\nAll pick-up orders must be paid for prior to pick-up. Payments will not be accepted on-site - no exceptions.\nNo Walk-Ins.\nIf you have not scheduled and received a confirmation of your pick up time, we will not be able to accommodate your pick up. Local pickup must be scheduled prior to arrival by calling Customer Service at 408-869-9262.\nThe pickup address for all items is 1600 Technology Drive, San Jose, CA 95110\nLocal pickup is available by appointment only and must be picked up within 30 days.",
